# Only the shared defaults and the generic example belong in git. Per-contest
# configs, and all/secret.yml (which holds a real jetbrains license key), stay
# local. This is an allowlist so a new file dropped in here is ignored by
# default rather than needing someone to remember a new rule.
#
# !.gitignore keeps this file itself tracked - it used to be swallowed by the
# leading * below, which meant none of these rules existed in a fresh clone.
*
!.gitignore
!generic.yml
!all/
all/*
!all/all.yml
!all/languages.yml
!all/tools.yml
